# The roadmap is a working document: what is built, what the rules are,
# what is still open. It stays local.
ROADMAP.md

# Ontology tooling: fetched on demand, not versioned (140 MB together).
# shared/README.md says where each one comes from.
*.jar
__pycache__/

# The generated documentation IS versioned: GitHub Pages serves it straight
# from main, so a page that is not committed is a page that does not resolve.
# Regenerate it with shared/make_docs.py rather than editing it.
#
# This includes the WebVOWL library Widoco copies into every documentation
# directory. Keeping it once and pointing the pages at that copy would be
# cheaper, but WebVOWL resolves its data file relative to its own location,
# so a shared copy would not find the data of each package.

# Widoco unpacks its LODE templates into a directory named after a timestamp
# and leaves it behind when a run is interrupted.
tmp[0-9]*/

# Rendered diagrams: regenerate with shared/make_figures.py.
# The PlantUML sources are versioned, the renderings are not.
odps/*/v*/figures/*.png
odps/*/v*/figures/*.svg
odps/*/v*/figures/*.eps
odps/*/v*/figures/*.pdf
alignment/*/v*/figures/*.png
alignment/*/v*/figures/*.svg
alignment/*/v*/figures/*.eps
alignment/*/v*/figures/*.pdf

# The hand drawn figures of version 1.0.0 are not rendered, so they stay.
!odps/*/v1.0.0/figures/figures-*.pdf
!alignment/*/v1.0.0/figures/figures-*.pdf

# Excerpts from purchased standards: kept locally while working on a pattern,
# never committed. The package TESTCASE.md says which figure each one holds.
odps/*/v*/figures/norm-*.png
odps/*/v*/figures/norm-*.pdf

# Editor and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.bak
